        "filing_date": "2025-11-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our products offer broadband service providers a competitive advantage at a crucial time when demand for fiber-based services is increasing to historic levels as providers focus on passing and connecting more homes.",
